<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Gudhjem–Helligdomsklipperne–Bådsted Havn — Gudhjem–Helligdomsklipperne–Bådsted Havn complete coastal hike</name><desc>From Nørresand harbour parking, follow the coastal rescue path through granite shoreline and wooded coves to Helligdomsklipperne. Descend to the cliff pier and return up the same steps, then continue to Bådsted harbour’s parking access near Søndre Strandvej. Plan the return journey before starting, carry supplies and follow current coastal signs and closures.

Route geometry: © OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0; https://www.openstreetmap.org/copyright and https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/1-0/. Changes: selected complete original walking-edge traversal for the cited coastal hike; canonical display simplified. Dense walking coordinates remain original OSM positions.

